{"id":2118,"level":80,"name":"Перевантаження (2)","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Overload occurs when a piece is assigned multiple defensive tasks, making the entire position vulnerable. With a clever move, you can ensure that an overloaded piece must give up one of its responsibilities, allowing you to win material.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Did you know blindfold chess is really possible? Strong players can visualize a board in their minds and move the pieces mentally. Some grandmasters can even play multiple games simultaneously in their heads. The record is held by Timur Gareyev, who played 48 games simultaneously. This also caused him to overload, as he had headaches for weeks afterward.</span></p><p><br></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"1r1r4/6pk/1R3p2/5b2/B4q1p/1QPp1P1P/PP4P1/3R3K b - - 0 31","pgn":"31... Rxb6 {[%csl Ra4,Rb3,Gb6,Gf4]} 32. Qxb6 Qxa4 * ","text":"<p>Білий ферзь перевантажена. Після розміну тури білий слон втрачається.</p><p><br></p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78146,"fen":"2r3k1/3n1pp1/3R1n1p/1p2p3/4b3/2P2NBP/2B2PP1/6K1 w - - 0 31","pgn":"{[%csl Rf6][%evp 0,3,117,176,175,164]} {Q=1} 31. Bxe4 Nxe4 {Q=2} 32. Rxd7 * ","format":27,"texts":["Чорний кінь перевантажений.","Безкоштовна фігура доступна!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78152,"fen":"1qr2rk1/pp2ppbp/3pb1p1/3P4/3BP3/1P3P2/P3B1PP/2RQ1RK1 b - - 0 15","pgn":"{[%csl Rd1][%evp 0,3,-371,-379,-374,-376]} {Q=1} 15... Rxc1 16. Qxc1 {Q=2} Bxd4+ * ","format":27,"texts":["Білий ферзь перевантажений.","Безкоштовна фігура доступна!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78150,"fen":"3rr1k1/pp3p1p/2q3p1/2p1n3/2P5/1Q3NP1/PP3PP1/3R1RK1 w - - 0 24","pgn":"{[%csl Re8][%evp 0,3,364,367,586,630]} {Q=1} 24. Nxe5 Rxe5 {Q=2} 25. Rxd8+ * ","format":27,"texts":["Чорна тура перевантажена.","Час заробляти!"],"text":"","isMu